From 1321543cd9908b3e4f2855633ad6edcf118cf28b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 12:48:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(mcp): turn the personal-data filter off; make it a
 three-way setting

The user decided to republish name lists, since they are public on the
official sites. PERSONAL_DATA_GUARD is now "off" | "student-ids" | "all";
re-running a source with the filter off restores withheld announcements.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FCgoUnzqQSfKjvqShB2hjh
